WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:42.550
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:42.820 --> 01:48.000
[When I Meet The Moon]

3
01:48.030 --> 01:51.009
[Episode 13]

4
01:54.770 --> 01:55.770
When we analyze

5
01:56.070 --> 01:57.650
these static relationships,

6
01:57.650 --> 01:58.710
we can make some assumptions.

7
01:58.710 --> 01:59.710
For example, it is

8
02:00.180 --> 02:02.310
a non-linear input factor.

9
02:02.680 --> 02:03.710
All inputs

10
02:03.870 --> 02:05.120
are non-linear.

11
02:05.350 --> 02:06.750
The input relationships

12
02:06.780 --> 02:07.920
are all linear.

13
02:14.430 --> 02:14.870
Look.

14
02:15.030 --> 02:16.160
Who is that outside?

15
02:16.190 --> 02:17.780
He's so handsome.

16
02:20.220 --> 02:21.130
That's all

17
02:21.310 --> 02:22.370
for today's class.

18
02:22.560 --> 02:24.020
Go back and review well.

19
02:24.150 --> 02:25.150
If you have any questions,

20
02:25.150 --> 02:26.060
ask me anytime.

21
02:26.210 --> 02:26.750
Okay.

22
02:27.870 --> 02:28.620
Let's go.

23
02:30.800 --> 02:32.810
Hey, class is over.

24
02:42.250 --> 02:43.380
Shize, you're here.

25
02:44.310 --> 02:45.170
Professor Che,

26
02:45.560 --> 02:46.960
how have you been lately?

27
02:47.910 --> 02:48.860
I'm doing great.

28
02:49.610 --> 02:50.470
What about you?

29
02:51.250 --> 02:52.110
How are you now?

30
02:54.100 --> 02:54.910
I'm...

31
02:55.750 --> 02:56.620
doing fine.

32
02:56.910 --> 02:57.710
Yeah.

33
02:58.420 --> 03:00.150
Compared to the last time I saw you,

34
03:00.150 --> 03:01.350
you look much better.

35
03:02.810 --> 03:04.710
Your mom came to see me a while ago,

36
03:05.470 --> 03:08.070
saying you still haven't planned to come back.

37
03:13.280 --> 03:14.020
I'm currently working

38
03:14.020 --> 03:15.480
at a VR experience center.

39
03:15.520 --> 03:16.380
I came this time

40
03:16.680 --> 03:17.360
to promote

41
03:17.360 --> 03:18.520
the new equipment.

42
03:19.360 --> 03:21.460
Working at an experience center is more interesting

43
03:21.460 --> 03:22.660
than staying in a lab.

44
03:24.620 --> 03:25.860
That's not bad either.

45
03:25.860 --> 03:27.370
At least, you still have

46
03:27.370 --> 03:29.430
some connection with this industry.

47
03:31.620 --> 03:32.410
Shize.

48
03:34.160 --> 03:35.260
I know you are

49
03:35.960 --> 03:37.650
a good kid with a sense of loyalty.

50
03:37.650 --> 03:39.750
It's rare for you to come back and see me.

51
03:39.750 --> 03:40.710
I'm quite happy.

52
03:41.530 --> 03:43.000
The school's lab has been

53
03:43.150 --> 03:44.350
renovated this year.

54
03:44.460 --> 03:46.210
We've added a lot of new equipment.

55
03:46.210 --> 03:48.350
The conditions are much better than before.

56
03:48.350 --> 03:49.280
If you have time,

57
03:49.780 --> 03:50.980
you can go take a look.

58
03:52.630 --> 03:53.750
This year, the School of Control Science and Engineering

59
03:53.750 --> 03:55.160
enrolled many students.

60
03:55.460 --> 03:56.250
However,

61
03:56.920 --> 03:57.800
there's still no one

62
03:57.800 --> 03:58.690
who can continue

63
03:58.690 --> 04:00.550
your intelligent robot project.

64
04:00.870 --> 04:01.930
It's a bit of a pity.

65
04:03.470 --> 04:04.520
I often think

66
04:05.650 --> 04:07.510
it would be great if you were here.

67
04:10.370 --> 04:11.700
I've disappointed you.

68
04:12.460 --> 04:13.880
Disappointed about what?

69
04:13.880 --> 04:14.690
Shize.

70
04:15.470 --> 04:16.370
I have never

71
04:16.560 --> 04:18.019
been disappointed in you.

72
04:19.060 --> 04:21.660
You shouldn't be disappointed in yourself either.

73
04:21.660 --> 04:23.250
You are my most outstanding student.

74
04:23.250 --> 04:24.220
No matter where you are,

75
04:24.220 --> 04:25.010
I believe

76
04:25.010 --> 04:26.120
you can do well.

77
04:27.890 --> 04:29.890
Come visit often when you have time.

78
04:31.220 --> 04:32.750
I'll leave you to your work.

79
05:17.250 --> 05:18.060
Shize?

80
05:19.370 --> 05:20.300
Why are you here?

81
05:21.370 --> 05:22.160
Have you collected all of

82
05:22.160 --> 05:23.620
today's experiment data?

83
05:24.400 --> 05:25.690
I'm just one step away

84
05:25.720 --> 05:26.980
from completing that.

85
05:27.070 --> 05:28.270
I have to go there now.

86
05:29.620 --> 05:30.950
That's impressive!

87
05:34.480 --> 05:35.070
Yuan.

88
05:36.560 --> 05:38.360
You haven't taken your medicine

89
05:38.490 --> 05:39.590
today, have you?

90
05:43.270 --> 05:44.270
I almost forgot.

91
06:02.060 --> 06:03.060
I'll talk to you after class.

92
06:03.060 --> 06:03.600
Okay.

93
06:39.960 --> 06:40.930
[Innovation Pioneer, Excellent Patent Award]

94
06:40.930 --> 06:41.900
[Automation] [Fu Shize]

95
06:51.159 --> 06:51.810
Excuse me.

96
06:53.080 --> 06:54.540
Which school are you from?

97
06:54.750 --> 06:55.570
How do you know

98
06:55.570 --> 06:56.970
I'm not from this school?

99
06:57.250 --> 06:58.659
I've been here for 8 years,

100
06:58.659 --> 07:00.190
from freshman to 5th-year PhD.

101
07:00.190 --> 07:00.740
I remember every girl

102
07:00.740 --> 07:02.180
clearly.

103
07:02.540 --> 07:03.740
Especially a beauty

104
07:03.740 --> 07:04.480
like you.

105
07:04.750 --> 07:05.800
I'm Chen Lirong.

106
07:06.500 --> 07:07.600
Shall we add each other on WeChat?

107
07:07.600 --> 07:08.430
No, thanks.

108
07:08.660 --> 07:09.450
Don't be shy.

109
07:09.450 --> 07:10.130
We can be friends.

110
07:10.130 --> 07:11.450
I have a boyfriend.

111
07:11.950 --> 07:12.950
Really?

112
07:14.070 --> 07:15.160
I-It's him.

113
07:15.810 --> 07:16.820
Fu Shize?

114
07:18.800 --> 07:19.570
What's wrong?

115
07:19.570 --> 07:22.030
He's been on leave of absence for over a year.

116
07:22.480 --> 07:23.330
If you want to reject me,

117
07:23.330 --> 07:25.120
find a better excuse.

118
07:27.910 --> 07:28.690
Hey!

119
07:36.380 --> 07:37.880
Is it really him?

120
07:47.330 --> 07:48.000
Delicious.

121
08:20.870 --> 08:22.010
What is she doing?

122
08:31.040 --> 08:32.100
What are you doing?

123
08:39.820 --> 08:40.620
Gosh,

124
08:40.740 --> 08:41.940
is your head made of stone?

125
08:41.940 --> 08:42.669
I haven't even screamed yet.

126
08:42.669 --> 08:44.000
Why were you screaming?

127
08:44.080 --> 08:44.840
You're the one slacking off

128
08:44.840 --> 08:46.240
and sleeping here, okay?

129
08:46.370 --> 08:47.230
What about you?

130
08:47.580 --> 08:48.320
Your leg is broken,

131
08:48.320 --> 08:50.010
and you're still wandering around.

132
08:50.010 --> 08:50.870
My mobility's limited,

133
08:50.870 --> 08:51.720
but not my spirit.

134
08:51.720 --> 08:52.980
And you were slacking off here.

135
08:52.980 --> 08:54.370
I saw it clearly.

136
08:54.530 --> 08:56.270
Don't look for trouble.

137
08:56.340 --> 08:57.370
Who's looking for trouble?

138
08:57.370 --> 08:58.170
You.

139
08:58.480 --> 09:00.080
What were you doing just now?

140
09:00.180 --> 09:01.310
Trying to ambush me?

141
09:01.510 --> 09:02.340
You're overthinking.

142
09:02.340 --> 09:03.170
You were lying there

143
09:03.170 --> 09:03.770
with your mouth pouting

144
09:03.770 --> 09:04.720
like a fish.

145
09:04.720 --> 09:05.910
I thought you were going to take the bait.

146
09:05.910 --> 09:06.390
You...

147
09:07.270 --> 09:08.800
I won't stoop to your level!

148
09:15.960 --> 09:16.480
Hello?

149
09:16.650 --> 09:17.360
Zhengchu.

150
09:17.770 --> 09:18.720
I found the person

151
09:18.720 --> 09:20.120
you asked me to look into.

152
09:20.270 --> 09:21.170
What's her name?

153
09:21.170 --> 09:22.720
She has many alt accounts

154
09:22.720 --> 09:23.780
and a main account.

155
09:23.820 --> 09:25.270
The main account has many followers.

156
09:25.270 --> 09:26.470
She's an influencer.

157
09:26.770 --> 09:27.580
Who is it?

158
09:27.920 --> 09:29.250
Fairy Feifei.

159
09:29.770 --> 09:31.250
Du Gefei?

160
09:52.480 --> 09:54.280
Have you been waiting here long?

161
09:54.440 --> 09:55.130
Yeah,

162
09:55.880 --> 09:57.140
but not too long.

163
09:57.440 --> 09:59.220
You didn't come out too late.

164
10:02.910 --> 10:03.980
I came because you left your wallet

165
10:03.980 --> 10:05.030
in the car.

166
10:05.630 --> 10:07.060
I was worried you might need it urgently,

167
10:07.060 --> 10:08.050
and I didn't know where you were,

168
10:08.050 --> 10:09.530
so I came here to wait for you.

169
10:09.530 --> 10:11.480
I called you a few times,

170
10:11.780 --> 10:12.810
but you didn't answer.

171
10:12.810 --> 10:14.140
You must have been busy.

172
10:16.010 --> 10:16.820
Thank you.

173
10:17.410 --> 10:18.340
You're welcome.

174
10:21.630 --> 10:22.290
You...

175
10:22.390 --> 10:23.850
It's getting pretty late.

176
10:24.120 --> 10:25.650
If you don't have any plans,

177
10:25.940 --> 10:27.940
do you want to grab dinner together?

178
10:33.410 --> 10:34.220
No, thanks.

179
10:35.370 --> 10:36.560
I'm heading back to the hotel.

180
10:36.560 --> 10:37.960
Let me drive you.

181
10:45.010 --> 10:47.220
Or I can wait for a taxi with you

182
10:47.340 --> 10:48.530
and see you off.

183
10:49.910 --> 10:50.980
It's raining,

184
10:50.980 --> 10:52.410
and you don't have an umbrella.

185
10:52.410 --> 10:53.760
It's not good to get wet.

186
10:59.320 --> 11:00.650
I'll help you get a taxi.

187
11:09.320 --> 11:11.580
Don't think I have any other intentions.

188
11:16.220 --> 11:17.670
I haven't got a taxi yet.

189
11:17.940 --> 11:19.800
It's hard to get one on a rainy day.

190
11:19.940 --> 11:20.840
What about you?

191
11:30.120 --> 11:31.520
I can't get a taxi either.

192
11:32.410 --> 11:33.910
How about I take you back?

193
11:34.380 --> 11:35.160
If I take you back,

194
11:35.160 --> 11:36.760
it's only a 10-minute drive.

195
11:37.980 --> 11:39.440
Both professionally and personally,

196
11:39.440 --> 11:41.130
I just hope you get back early.

197
11:45.000 --> 11:46.200
Give me the umbrella.

198
12:40.440 --> 12:41.270
Did you bring

199
12:41.270 --> 12:42.800
the VR equipment this time?

200
12:43.670 --> 12:44.480
Yes, I did.

201
12:45.630 --> 12:46.460
Ms. Fang asked me to shoot

202
12:46.460 --> 12:46.940
EAW

203
12:46.940 --> 12:48.220
for EAW.

204
12:48.440 --> 12:49.970
I want my brother to be in it.

205
12:50.270 --> 12:52.270
Can I borrow it from you tomorrow?

206
12:54.630 --> 12:56.310
When you arrive later,

207
12:56.340 --> 12:58.030
just give it to me when you get off.

208
12:58.030 --> 13:00.170
I'll return it to you at XUST the day after tomorrow.

209
13:00.170 --> 13:01.970
You don't need to come tomorrow.

210
13:04.530 --> 13:05.270
I brought

211
13:05.270 --> 13:06.890
the latest equipment this time.

212
13:06.890 --> 13:08.690
You don't know how to operate it.

213
13:11.630 --> 13:12.720
Never mind then.

214
13:27.980 --> 13:29.110
What time tomorrow?

215
13:33.390 --> 13:34.520
Ten o'clock is fine.

216
13:35.480 --> 13:36.790
I can come pick you up,

217
13:37.290 --> 13:39.150
or you can tell me when you arrive.

218
13:43.120 --> 13:43.910
It's okay.

219
13:44.480 --> 13:45.680
I'll go there myself.

220
13:46.270 --> 13:46.860
Okay.

221
14:13.910 --> 14:15.310
Too flashy.

222
14:21.320 --> 14:22.320
Too plain.

223
14:22.320 --> 14:23.980
Looks like I'm going to work.

224
14:25.010 --> 14:26.610
Though, it's all for my work.

225
14:31.790 --> 14:32.500
Li,

226
14:32.770 --> 14:33.830
what are you doing?

227
14:34.360 --> 14:35.690
You're being so sneaky.

228
14:37.460 --> 14:38.080
If I didn't know better,

229
14:38.080 --> 14:39.620
I'd think we had a burglar.

230
14:39.620 --> 14:41.120
I'm hanging up clothes.

231
14:41.250 --> 14:42.480
Hanging up clothes,

232
14:42.480 --> 14:44.170
or going on a blind date tomorrow?

233
14:44.170 --> 14:45.080
What nonsense are you talking about?

234
14:45.080 --> 14:45.620
Can you talk to me

235
14:45.620 --> 14:47.220
about your studies for once?

236
14:47.870 --> 14:49.070
Why are you in my room?

237
14:49.360 --> 14:50.080
What's up?

238
14:50.720 --> 14:51.340
Li,

239
14:51.430 --> 14:53.170
I specially heated some milk for you.

240
14:53.170 --> 14:54.500
Drink it while it's hot.

241
14:58.080 --> 15:00.610
You're being overly attentive for no reason.

242
15:04.120 --> 15:05.480
What exactly do you want?

243
15:05.480 --> 15:07.410
You're not trying to borrow money, are you?

244
15:07.410 --> 15:08.510
I've drunk the milk,

245
15:08.510 --> 15:09.650
but I have no money in my pockets.

246
15:09.650 --> 15:11.110
Let me tell you that first.

247
15:13.030 --> 15:14.720
It's not about money.

248
15:15.220 --> 15:16.080
Then what is it?

249
15:17.600 --> 15:18.270
Li,

250
15:18.540 --> 15:19.660
about Yunyi,

251
15:19.680 --> 15:21.340
can you keep it a secret for me?

252
15:21.370 --> 15:22.630
Don't tell Mom and Dad.

253
15:23.100 --> 15:23.700
Besides,

254
15:23.700 --> 15:24.740
there's nothing going on between us.

255
15:24.740 --> 15:26.130
We're just studying together

256
15:26.130 --> 15:27.080
and helping each other out.

257
15:27.080 --> 15:28.480
There better be nothing.

258
15:29.120 --> 15:30.170
I'll see how you behave.

259
15:30.170 --> 15:31.830
Go back to your room and sleep.

260
15:32.890 --> 15:33.410
Okay.

261
15:36.270 --> 15:37.200
I borrowed VR equipment

262
15:37.200 --> 15:38.130
from my colleague.

263
15:38.130 --> 15:39.120
He'll bring it tomorrow

264
15:39.120 --> 15:40.250
for you to play with.

265
15:41.440 --> 15:42.240
VR equipment?

266
15:42.770 --> 15:43.630
What kind?

267
15:43.650 --> 15:44.860
The fun kind.

268
15:44.860 --> 15:45.480
When the time comes,

269
15:45.480 --> 15:46.910
I might need you to appear

270
15:46.910 --> 15:47.860
in a video.

271
15:48.650 --> 15:49.750
I knew it.

272
15:50.120 --> 15:51.010
I was wondering why you were suddenly

273
15:51.010 --> 15:52.360
so nice to your own brother.

274
15:52.360 --> 15:54.030
You had an ulterior motive.

275
15:54.460 --> 15:55.360
You may leave.

276
15:56.360 --> 15:56.940
Okay.

277
17:00.740 --> 17:02.340
Heart-shaped.

278
17:05.109 --> 17:05.970
Strawberries?

279
17:06.020 --> 17:06.510
Give me one.

280
17:06.510 --> 17:07.910
Did you clean the toilet?

281
17:07.920 --> 17:09.329
I scrubbed it 3 times.

282
17:09.329 --> 17:10.030
Yun Ye!

283
17:10.880 --> 17:12.069
The toilets in five-star hotels

284
17:12.069 --> 17:12.900
aren't as clean as ours.

285
17:12.900 --> 17:14.630
Try shoving it in my face again.

286
17:15.550 --> 17:16.770
There's even a heart-shaped one.

287
17:16.770 --> 17:18.160
These are for our guest.

288
17:19.010 --> 17:20.349
Can the guest eat a whole plate?

289
17:20.349 --> 17:21.310
What's wrong with me eating two?

290
17:21.310 --> 17:22.050
No way.

291
17:22.810 --> 17:24.349
I'm going to take out the trash now.

292
17:24.349 --> 17:25.750
If one strawberry is missing,

293
17:25.750 --> 17:27.349
I'll stuff you in the toilet.

294
17:45.280 --> 17:46.530
It's just strawberries.

295
17:46.530 --> 17:48.730
It's not like I haven't had them before.

296
17:59.660 --> 18:00.460
Fu Shize.

297
18:00.740 --> 18:01.300
Morning.

298
18:01.320 --> 18:03.580
You're here so early.

299
18:04.310 --> 18:05.570
Why didn't you come in?

300
18:06.700 --> 18:07.550
I woke up early,

301
18:07.550 --> 18:09.150
so I just came straight here.

302
18:09.590 --> 18:10.850
How long have you been waiting outside?

303
18:10.850 --> 18:12.050
Are you cold?

304
18:12.720 --> 18:13.510
I'm fine.

305
18:16.480 --> 18:17.700
Come in with me.

306
18:18.160 --> 18:18.660
Mm.

307
18:27.240 --> 18:28.970
I'll get you a pair of slippers.

308
18:31.900 --> 18:32.430
Thanks.

309
18:32.640 --> 18:33.110
Yun Li,

310
18:33.480 --> 18:35.280
about the money for cleaning...

311
18:39.320 --> 18:39.850
Li,

312
18:39.900 --> 18:41.200
isn't this the guy

313
18:41.200 --> 18:42.660
in your high school photo?

314
18:44.830 --> 18:45.630
Yun Ye.

315
18:49.880 --> 18:50.500
Hello.

316
18:51.010 --> 18:51.900
I'm Fu Shize.

317
18:52.510 --> 18:54.070
Hello, I'm Yun Ye.

318
18:56.160 --> 18:58.490
You probably mistook me for someone else.

319
19:01.800 --> 19:02.560
Sorry about that.

320
19:02.560 --> 19:04.020
I must have been mistaken.

321
19:04.210 --> 19:05.160
After I looked closely,

322
19:05.160 --> 19:06.890
you're completely different.

323
19:10.180 --> 19:11.220
Besides, my sister

324
19:11.220 --> 19:12.610
never pursues anyone.

325
19:18.700 --> 19:19.160
I...

326
19:19.160 --> 19:19.550
Shize,

327
19:19.550 --> 19:21.280
I'll go get you a glass of water.

328
19:24.720 --> 19:25.590
Sit here.

329
19:31.890 --> 19:33.630
Just connect it to this TV.

330
19:34.010 --> 19:34.500
Mm.

331
19:35.530 --> 19:36.630
What's the Wi-Fi password?

332
19:36.630 --> 19:38.830
Yunyebielian (Yun Ye, don't connect).

333
19:41.010 --> 19:43.200
The password is in lowercase pinyin.

334
19:44.090 --> 19:44.890
You go ahead.

335
19:48.380 --> 19:49.220
You're good here.

336
19:49.220 --> 19:50.330
Hurry back to your room.

337
19:50.330 --> 19:51.030
Li,

338
19:51.290 --> 19:53.520
is that my future brother-in-law?

339
19:53.850 --> 19:55.380
What are you talking about?

340
19:55.660 --> 19:56.460
Go upstairs.

341
19:56.700 --> 19:57.480
Well...

342
19:57.660 --> 19:58.350
Get out.

343
19:59.560 --> 20:00.310
Okay, okay.

344
20:02.660 --> 20:03.000
Shize,

345
20:03.000 --> 20:04.330
I'll go study in my room.

346
20:30.500 --> 20:31.610
What's wrong?

347
20:35.110 --> 20:35.770
Nothing.

348
20:36.680 --> 20:38.010
Have you had breakfast?

349
20:38.590 --> 20:39.090
Mm.

350
20:50.310 --> 20:51.910
The photo he just mentioned—

351
20:52.090 --> 20:53.020
what photo is it?

352
20:55.420 --> 20:56.220
I washed some strawberries.

353
20:56.220 --> 20:57.030
Have some.

354
20:58.850 --> 20:59.510
No, thanks.

355
21:09.980 --> 21:11.000
Can we play now?

356
21:14.530 --> 21:16.310
We'll record a segment together later.

357
21:16.310 --> 21:16.810
And then I'll...

358
21:16.810 --> 21:18.340
I'll record a solo segment.

359
21:18.380 --> 21:19.030
What?

360
21:19.030 --> 21:19.920
Speak slower.

361
21:20.170 --> 21:20.960
I said

362
21:21.610 --> 21:22.640
we'll record a segment together.

363
21:22.640 --> 21:24.610
And then I'll record a solo segment.

364
21:24.610 --> 21:25.420
Okay, okay, okay.

365
21:25.420 --> 21:25.960
Come on.

366
21:31.550 --> 21:31.880
Yun Ye,

367
21:31.880 --> 21:33.740
you know how to operate it, right?

368
21:34.200 --> 21:34.920
I think so.

369
21:35.680 --> 21:36.260
Is it okay?

370
21:36.260 --> 21:36.720
Yes.

371
21:37.140 --> 21:37.740
It's fine.

372
21:44.400 --> 21:45.810
This is so cool.

373
21:46.500 --> 21:48.430
As expected of the latest version.

374
21:48.720 --> 21:50.520
Yun Li, which one are we playing?

375
21:52.980 --> 21:53.940
Choose the hardest one.

376
21:53.680 --> 21:56.490
♪ I look up at the sky ♪

377
21:54.440 --> 21:55.440
Sure, no problem.

378
21:57.250 --> 21:59.900
♪ And there you are, always by my side ♪

379
22:00.700 --> 22:03.110
♪ Since when did it begin? ♪

380
22:03.130 --> 22:06.330
♪ I can't quite recall ♪

381
22:07.240 --> 22:10.330
♪ You became the clouds in my dreams ♪

382
22:09.350 --> 22:10.240
Okay.

383
22:10.820 --> 22:12.980
♪ Silent and weightless ♪

384
22:12.240 --> 22:12.740
Come on.

385
22:13.250 --> 22:16.290
♪ I wish I could stay ♪

386
22:16.990 --> 22:20.290
♪ Walking by your side forever ♪

387
22:18.090 --> 22:18.820
Let's start.

388
22:18.980 --> 22:19.530
Come on.

389
22:21.860 --> 22:24.790
♪ Through seasons of endless change ♪

390
22:24.810 --> 22:26.970
♪ Through tides that ebb and flow ♪

391
22:28.850 --> 22:31.800
♪ Letting moments overlap ♪

392
22:31.820 --> 22:34.110
♪ As we feel the world transform ♪

393
22:35.190 --> 22:38.760
♪ I'm just glad I was brave enough ♪

394
22:38.930 --> 22:41.790
♪ To meet the moon ♪

395
22:40.940 --> 22:41.400
This is a bit...

396
22:41.400 --> 22:42.270
a bit scary.

397
22:41.820 --> 22:44.750
♪ Gently, I pluck a piece of it ♪

398
22:42.700 --> 22:43.290
That's why

399
22:43.290 --> 22:44.880
you should stand in front of me.

400
22:44.770 --> 22:47.660
♪ And let loneliness fade away ♪

401
22:47.500 --> 22:48.610
Careful, careful.

402
22:47.690 --> 22:51.850
♪ All I want is to be with you ♪

403
22:48.610 --> 22:49.270
Yun Ye, Yun Ye,

404
22:49.270 --> 22:50.240
pick that up for me.

405
22:50.240 --> 22:50.790
Hurry.

406
22:50.790 --> 22:51.440
Right.

407
22:52.170 --> 22:55.040
♪ That's the only thing that matters ♪

408
22:55.150 --> 22:58.890
♪ Love gives us all ♪

409
22:58.530 --> 22:59.530
This game is addictive!

410
22:58.910 --> 23:01.970
♪ Like the moon lighting up every night ♪

411
23:01.990 --> 23:02.810
♪ You know ♪

412
23:02.830 --> 23:06.070
♪ I want to fall in love with you ♪

413
23:05.250 --> 23:06.050
Is it fun?

414
23:06.090 --> 23:08.900
♪ No matter how many times I say I love you ♪

415
23:07.110 --> 23:08.050
It's pretty fun.

416
23:08.180 --> 23:09.400
It's just a bit scary.

417
23:08.920 --> 23:12.500
♪ Clouds, please drift a little closer ♪

418
23:10.590 --> 23:11.790
Have some strawberries.

419
23:11.790 --> 23:12.310
Okay.

420
23:13.400 --> 23:18.300
♪ I could say it ten thousand times and never tire ♪

421
23:13.500 --> 23:14.330
Have a seat.

422
23:26.180 --> 23:27.740
He's so handsome.

423
23:27.840 --> 23:30.970
It would be nice if he could really be my brother-in-law.

424
23:35.220 --> 23:36.880
Is there something on my face?

425
23:37.180 --> 23:37.980
No.

426
23:48.070 --> 23:48.660
Shize,

427
23:49.590 --> 23:51.200
are you from XUST?

428
23:52.000 --> 23:52.570
Mm.

429
23:56.610 --> 23:57.640
How do you know?

430
23:58.100 --> 23:59.830
My sister mentioned it before.

431
24:00.740 --> 24:01.940
Have you been to XUST?

432
24:02.510 --> 24:04.440
My sister took me there a few times.

433
24:05.010 --> 24:06.220
To visit?

434
24:06.310 --> 24:07.980
No, to look for someone.

435
24:08.310 --> 24:09.030
My sister said

436
24:09.030 --> 24:10.290
she had a friend there.

437
24:10.360 --> 24:12.090
Then we read books there

438
24:12.680 --> 24:14.540
and watched a drone competition.

439
24:15.940 --> 24:17.800
You watched a drone competition?

440
24:17.940 --> 24:18.570
Yeah.

441
24:18.570 --> 24:19.570
It was super cool.

442
24:19.570 --> 24:21.630
I want to fly drones in the future too.

443
24:23.550 --> 24:24.030
Mm.

444
24:24.420 --> 24:25.220
That's great.

445
24:26.610 --> 24:29.330
But there are some problems

446
24:29.330 --> 24:30.380
I can't figure out,

447
24:30.380 --> 24:32.000
and my classmates don't understand either.

448
24:32.000 --> 24:33.590
Who should I ask, Shize?

449
24:34.260 --> 24:35.350
I'm quite familiar

450
24:35.380 --> 24:36.530
with drones.

451
24:36.920 --> 24:37.640
If there's anything you don't understand,

452
24:37.640 --> 24:38.970
you can ask me directly.

453
24:39.220 --> 24:40.330
Really, Shize?

454
24:40.440 --> 24:42.170
Let's add each other on WeChat.

455
24:43.720 --> 24:44.920
That's for biting me.

456
24:45.010 --> 24:46.210
That's for biting me.

457
24:49.180 --> 24:49.750
Shize,

458
24:49.750 --> 24:51.750
I want to go to XUST in the future too.

459
24:52.030 --> 24:53.490
Are you a science student?

460
24:53.830 --> 24:54.830
Yes, I am.

461
24:54.950 --> 24:55.530
XUST's

462
24:55.550 --> 24:57.330
Measurement and Control Technology and Instruments,

463
24:57.330 --> 24:58.140
Information Engineering,

464
24:58.140 --> 25:00.400
and Systems Science are all pretty good.

465
25:03.740 --> 25:05.090
How about Automation?

466
25:05.110 --> 25:05.940
It's also pretty good.

467
25:05.940 --> 25:07.400
My sister is in that major.

468
25:10.350 --> 25:10.900
Mm.

469
25:11.530 --> 25:12.090
Shize,

470
25:12.480 --> 25:14.210
my sister is a very good person.

471
25:14.640 --> 25:15.180
Mm.

472
25:15.940 --> 25:17.270
She's really great.

473
25:17.270 --> 25:18.530
Really, really great.

474
25:22.770 --> 25:24.090
This is a bit hard.

475
25:27.700 --> 25:28.090
Yun Ye,

476
25:28.090 --> 25:29.470
didn't you say you had a lot of homework?

477
25:29.470 --> 25:30.730
Why are you still here?

478
25:30.750 --> 25:31.700
She's really, really...

479
25:31.700 --> 25:32.250
Go upstairs.

480
25:32.250 --> 25:32.650
Go.

481
25:34.440 --> 25:35.510
What did you say to Fu Shize?

482
25:35.510 --> 25:36.910
Did you spill my secrets?

483
25:37.210 --> 25:38.080
No.

484
25:38.970 --> 25:40.900
I was putting in a good word for you.

485
25:41.030 --> 25:41.720
You?

486
25:43.480 --> 25:44.220
Really.

487
25:44.220 --> 25:45.420
I swear to God.

488
25:47.570 --> 25:48.590
You'd better be.

489
26:03.770 --> 26:05.430
Did you eat the strawberries?

490
26:07.250 --> 26:07.750
No.

491
26:18.280 --> 26:18.750
Did you eat

492
26:18.750 --> 26:19.750
my strawberries?

493
26:20.180 --> 26:21.050
There were so many.

494
26:21.050 --> 26:22.050
How would I know?

495
26:22.440 --> 26:24.030
T-The one on top

496
26:24.680 --> 26:25.740
with a heart shape.

497
26:26.070 --> 26:27.740
I don't know which one,

498
26:27.740 --> 26:29.310
but I ate a lot.

499
26:29.740 --> 26:30.270
Yun Ye,

500
26:30.270 --> 26:31.830
you really piss me off!

501
26:32.680 --> 26:33.480
Don't even think about

502
26:33.480 --> 26:34.410
eating the rest.

503
26:35.220 --> 26:36.510
Even a stranger I just met

504
26:36.510 --> 26:37.980
knows to give your brother strawberries.

505
26:37.980 --> 26:38.420
Yun Li,

506
26:38.420 --> 26:40.090
you've been my sister for 16 years.

507
26:40.090 --> 26:42.140
Why don't you have any self-awareness?

508
26:42.140 --> 26:42.880
No, you...

509
27:25.120 --> 27:26.340
Are you leaving?

510
27:27.440 --> 27:27.980
Mm.

511
27:28.030 --> 27:29.050
I'll walk you out.

512
28:14.380 --> 28:15.420
Are you okay?

513
28:17.000 --> 28:18.000
What's wrong?

514
28:21.810 --> 28:22.700
Stomachache?

515
28:24.600 --> 28:26.260
I'll take you to the hospital.

516
28:28.720 --> 28:29.520
No need.

517
28:31.850 --> 28:32.720
I'm used to it.

518
28:33.660 --> 28:34.990
It'll be fine in a while.

519
28:44.250 --> 28:45.660
Are you feeling better?

520
28:50.400 --> 28:51.900
Can I take you

521
28:51.900 --> 28:53.420
to the hospital now?

522
28:55.530 --> 28:56.930
Take me back to the hotel.

523
28:58.680 --> 29:00.140
I need to sleep for a while.

524
29:22.090 --> 29:23.200
Dad, time to eat!

525
29:24.420 --> 29:25.290
Next time,

526
29:25.290 --> 29:26.270
tell me earlier.

527
29:26.610 --> 29:27.460
It makes things

528
29:27.460 --> 29:28.160
too stressful.

529
29:28.160 --> 29:28.850
Thanks for your hard work, Mom.

530
29:28.850 --> 29:29.460
Right.

531
29:29.460 --> 29:29.960
Yeah.

532
29:36.750 --> 29:37.660
This Li

533
29:38.550 --> 29:40.200
has requested leave at such short notice.

534
29:40.200 --> 29:40.960
Where am I supposed

535
29:40.960 --> 29:42.420
to find a replacement now?

536
29:42.750 --> 29:44.480
Then discuss it with him again.

537
29:44.790 --> 29:45.610
Forget it.

538
29:46.190 --> 29:49.260
Li's daughter is taking the college entrance exam next year.

539
29:49.260 --> 29:50.920
While he can still manage her,

540
29:51.840 --> 29:53.060
he should do it now.

541
29:53.720 --> 29:55.760
Soon she'll be far away,

542
29:56.350 --> 29:59.210
and he won't be able to manage her even if he wants to.

543
30:01.460 --> 30:02.860
I'll have a shrimp first.

544
30:02.920 --> 30:03.980
What are you doing?

545
30:04.660 --> 30:05.900
So eager to eat?

546
30:09.500 --> 30:10.740
What did you do at home today?

547
30:10.740 --> 30:11.800
Studied hard.

548
30:12.310 --> 30:14.250
I didn't even leave my room.

549
30:18.500 --> 30:19.290
Yun Li,

550
30:19.810 --> 30:20.660
did you make your brother

551
30:20.660 --> 30:22.260
help you shoot a video today?

552
30:25.790 --> 30:26.590
Your brother is taking the college entrance exam next year.

553
30:26.590 --> 30:27.790
You know that, right?

554
30:28.790 --> 30:29.460
It's fine if you

555
30:29.460 --> 30:30.860
mess around by yourself.

556
30:30.900 --> 30:31.720
Why are you dragging your brother

557
30:31.720 --> 30:32.850
into your nonsense?

558
30:34.270 --> 30:35.030
Lili finally

559
30:35.050 --> 30:35.900
came home.

560
30:35.900 --> 30:37.830
Let's talk about something happy.

561
30:42.460 --> 30:44.860
I told you not to go to Nanwu for grad school,

562
30:45.090 --> 30:45.810
right?

563
30:45.810 --> 30:47.540
You just did it without asking.

564
30:47.590 --> 30:48.790
Now that you're back,

565
30:48.900 --> 30:49.660
you're dragging your brother

566
30:49.660 --> 30:50.590
to shoot videos.

567
30:51.750 --> 30:52.160
Well,

568
30:52.160 --> 30:53.250
are you really planning

569
30:53.250 --> 30:54.450
to support yourself?

570
30:55.350 --> 30:55.810
Dad,

571
30:55.810 --> 30:57.340
I just appeared on camera today.

572
30:57.340 --> 30:58.510
I didn't do anything else,

573
30:58.510 --> 30:59.850
and it didn't delay my studies.

574
30:59.850 --> 31:00.700
Shut up.

575
31:02.610 --> 31:04.400
How many times have I told you?

576
31:04.750 --> 31:05.590
I told you to come back to Xifu

577
31:05.590 --> 31:07.290
and find a proper job.

578
31:07.350 --> 31:08.250
But you

579
31:08.610 --> 31:10.340
just do useless things all day.

580
31:10.660 --> 31:11.090
Right.

581
31:11.980 --> 31:13.640
You've been a content creator

582
31:13.790 --> 31:15.010
for a few years now.

583
31:15.010 --> 31:16.400
What have you achieved?

584
31:17.420 --> 31:18.660
As a girl,

585
31:19.000 --> 31:20.700
you shoot videos and post them online all day.

586
31:20.700 --> 31:21.460
You just let people

587
31:21.460 --> 31:22.290
judge you.

588
31:22.290 --> 31:23.350
Aren't you ashamed?

589
31:23.350 --> 31:23.680
Wait,

590
31:23.680 --> 31:25.420
how is shooting videos shameful?

591
31:25.420 --> 31:26.220
So many people shoot videos.

592
31:26.220 --> 31:27.430
Why is it only shameful for me?

593
31:27.430 --> 31:28.560
People get scolded

594
31:28.580 --> 31:29.350
and doxxed online.

595
31:29.350 --> 31:30.700
Do you want to be like them?

596
31:30.700 --> 31:32.000
It's not that scary.

597
31:32.020 --> 31:33.000
Taste this. How is it?

598
31:33.000 --> 31:33.790
No,

599
31:34.110 --> 31:35.000
let me tell you.

600
31:35.200 --> 31:37.260
Things are different now.

601
31:37.290 --> 31:38.090
Nowadays, anyone can easily

602
31:38.090 --> 31:39.200
spread rumors.

603
31:39.480 --> 31:40.870
Once they post it online

604
31:40.900 --> 31:42.090
and it spreads,

605
31:42.110 --> 31:42.810
they can turn white

606
31:42.810 --> 31:43.850
into black.

607
31:43.920 --> 31:46.050
By then, let alone on the internet,

608
31:46.220 --> 31:47.000
even in real life,

609
31:47.000 --> 31:47.640
it'll be hard to survive.

610
31:47.640 --> 31:48.290
Do you understand?

611
31:48.290 --> 31:49.030
If being a content creator

612
31:49.030 --> 31:49.760
is this hard,

613
31:50.110 --> 31:50.810
then just being a person

614
31:50.810 --> 31:51.940
is really hard.

615
31:51.960 --> 31:53.060
Watch your mouth.

616
31:53.810 --> 31:55.140
I'm looking out for you.

617
31:55.250 --> 31:55.920
I'm full.

618
31:55.920 --> 31:56.810
I'm going out for a walk.

619
31:56.810 --> 31:57.160
Li.

620
31:57.160 --> 31:57.510
Lili.

621
31:57.510 --> 31:58.660
You think you're so tough?

622
31:58.660 --> 32:00.390
Who are you giving attitude to?

623
32:02.180 --> 32:04.040
Are you going through menopause?

624
32:05.750 --> 32:08.270
I... I'm looking out for her.

625
32:56.310 --> 32:57.740
Have you had dinner?

626
33:01.900 --> 33:03.110
Near your place,

627
33:03.110 --> 33:04.880
there's a famous fish congee restaurant.

628
33:04.880 --> 33:06.330
It's good for the stomach.

629
33:06.330 --> 33:08.680
Shall we go eat together?

630
33:57.610 --> 33:59.210
I bought some fish fillet congee.

631
33:59.210 --> 34:00.300
Do you want some?

632
34:11.440 --> 34:12.580
You have a bad stomach.

633
34:12.580 --> 34:14.639
I bought you some fish fillet congee.

634
34:29.030 --> 34:29.600
Hello.

635
34:29.620 --> 34:30.070
Hello.

636
34:30.090 --> 34:32.110
Could you give this to the guest in 3006

637
34:32.110 --> 34:33.760
named Fu Shize?

638
34:33.960 --> 34:35.090
May I ask who you are?

639
34:35.360 --> 34:36.320
I'm his friend.

640
34:36.510 --> 34:37.320
Just tell him.

641
34:37.320 --> 34:38.179
He should know.

642
34:38.420 --> 34:38.880
Okay.

643
34:40.610 --> 34:41.340
Thank you.

644
34:43.600 --> 34:44.449
I'm sorry.

645
34:44.480 --> 34:45.880
This gentleman is not in.

646
34:47.880 --> 34:48.550
Thank you.

647
34:59.960 --> 35:00.880
Fu Shize,

648
35:01.760 --> 35:03.050
where are you?

649
35:26.760 --> 35:28.090
Why is it you, Qingsong?

650
35:28.150 --> 35:28.960
You scared me.

651
35:29.320 --> 35:31.360
I wanted to ask you the same question.

652
35:31.360 --> 35:32.510
Your leg is hurt like this,

653
35:32.510 --> 35:33.960
and you're still out fooling around.

654
35:33.960 --> 35:35.220
Does your sister know?

655
35:35.320 --> 35:36.480
I'm not fooling around.

656
35:36.480 --> 35:37.610
I'm out on business.

657
35:37.630 --> 35:40.030
And I have my sister's special permission.

658
35:40.050 --> 35:40.760
Qingsong,

659
35:40.760 --> 35:41.760
why don't you go do your thing?

660
35:41.760 --> 35:42.780
Don't hold me up.

661
35:43.010 --> 35:44.260
What business do you have?

662
35:44.260 --> 35:44.980
I...

663
35:45.000 --> 35:46.200
You're just an idler.

664
35:46.860 --> 35:47.610
Besides,

665
35:47.610 --> 35:49.210
who does business in a bar?

666
35:49.480 --> 35:51.110
You're just making things up.

667
35:51.110 --> 35:52.320
I'm warning you.

668
35:52.320 --> 35:53.670
Your mom told me

669
35:53.980 --> 35:56.280
to keep an eye on you and stop you from messing around.

670
35:56.280 --> 35:57.420
I don't expect you to excel in your studies,

671
35:57.420 --> 35:58.980
but you need to at least graduate without any problems.

672
35:58.980 --> 36:00.110
I'm really not lying to you.

673
36:00.110 --> 36:01.260
I'm really out on business.

674
36:01.260 --> 36:02.480
Look, she's here.

675
36:04.690 --> 36:05.230
See?

676
36:07.110 --> 36:08.050
Let me tell you.

677
36:08.260 --> 36:09.860
This girl is not simple.

678
36:09.860 --> 36:11.570
She's not someone you can handle.

679
36:11.570 --> 36:13.230
You'd better not provoke her.

680
36:13.280 --> 36:14.070
I know, Qingsong.

681
36:14.070 --> 36:14.860
Don't worry.

682
36:14.860 --> 36:16.060
I know what I'm doing.

683
36:16.640 --> 36:17.450
Zhengchu.

684
36:17.610 --> 36:18.420
Here, Gefei.

685
36:24.050 --> 36:24.860
Mr. Xu.

686
36:25.360 --> 36:26.550
Why are you here too?

687
36:26.920 --> 36:27.920
Just hanging out.

688
36:28.110 --> 36:29.840
We just bumped into each other.

689
36:29.850 --> 36:30.640
Then

690
36:31.010 --> 36:32.210
do you want to have a drink together?

691
36:32.210 --> 36:32.920
No.

692
36:33.210 --> 36:34.200
I have things to do.

693
36:34.200 --> 36:35.050
You guys chat.

694
36:35.670 --> 36:36.800
Bye-bye, Qingosng.

695
36:37.810 --> 36:38.770
Gefei, sit here.

696
36:42.420 --> 36:43.630
Zhengchu.

697
36:43.860 --> 36:45.700
Isn't your leg still not healed?

698
36:46.040 --> 36:46.920
Why are you in such a hurry

699
36:46.920 --> 36:47.760
to ask me out?

700
36:48.070 --> 36:48.920
I was just thinking that

701
36:48.920 --> 36:49.760
after my leg heals,

702
36:49.760 --> 36:51.150
I'll try being a streamer too.

703
36:51.150 --> 36:51.880
I heard you're on EAW,

704
36:51.880 --> 36:52.480
and you're really popular.

705
36:52.480 --> 36:54.530
Can you give me some tips?

706
36:55.570 --> 36:56.650
It's not like that.

707
36:56.940 --> 36:59.010
I just dance.

708
36:59.550 --> 37:00.150
Zhengchu,

709
37:00.150 --> 37:01.530
you're so good at skateboarding.

710
37:01.530 --> 37:02.380
If you become a sports streamer,

711
37:02.380 --> 37:04.110
you'll definitely be popular.

712
37:04.390 --> 37:06.580
But I'm a bit fragile.

713
37:06.610 --> 37:08.140
What if someone hates on me?

714
37:08.670 --> 37:09.550
When you encounter haters,

715
37:09.550 --> 37:10.950
how do you deal with them?

716
37:11.980 --> 37:13.840
You definitely have to hate back.

717
37:13.980 --> 37:15.840
You can't just suffer in silence.

718
37:16.670 --> 37:17.320
Well,

719
37:17.550 --> 37:18.070
you see,

720
37:18.360 --> 37:19.360
I'm a skateboarder.

721
37:19.360 --> 37:20.010
And another person

722
37:20.010 --> 37:21.150
is also a skateboarder.

723
37:21.150 --> 37:21.510
What if

724
37:21.510 --> 37:22.210
our audiences overlap

725
37:22.210 --> 37:22.980
and he steals my fans?

726
37:22.980 --> 37:23.910
What should I do?

727
37:24.650 --> 37:26.070
That's possible.

728
37:26.980 --> 37:28.510
The number of fans in any field

729
37:28.510 --> 37:29.440
is limited.

730
37:29.760 --> 37:30.650
One more streamer

731
37:30.650 --> 37:32.510
takes away a share of the traffic.

732
37:32.550 --> 37:33.510
Then the money you earn

733
37:33.510 --> 37:34.770
will decrease, right?

734
37:34.980 --> 37:35.670
Yeah.

735
37:36.190 --> 37:37.170
So what should I do?

736
37:37.170 --> 37:38.170
Just endure it?

737
37:38.920 --> 37:39.920
Are you stupid?

738
37:40.420 --> 37:41.950
Find someone to hate on him.

739
37:43.480 --> 37:44.650
We're in the same industry.

740
37:44.650 --> 37:46.510
It's not good to hate on him, is it?

741
37:46.980 --> 37:49.900
What's wrong with that?

742
37:50.610 --> 37:52.620
In this day and age,

743
37:52.650 --> 37:54.460
traffic is king.

744
37:54.880 --> 37:56.320
It's money.

745
37:56.570 --> 37:58.510
You treat him as a peer,

746
37:58.710 --> 38:00.240
but he might

747
38:00.380 --> 38:02.070
treat you as an enemy.

748
38:02.780 --> 38:04.550
Then how do I hate on him?

749
38:09.070 --> 38:10.780
Just find someone to dig up dirt on him,

750
38:10.780 --> 38:11.980
put it online,

751
38:12.210 --> 38:13.670
and make up some rumors.

752
38:14.110 --> 38:14.920
When the time comes,

753
38:14.920 --> 38:16.460
you won't have to do anything.

754
38:16.460 --> 38:17.570
Netizens will naturally help you

755
38:17.570 --> 38:18.790
blow things out of proportion.

756
38:18.790 --> 38:20.250
You just sit back and win.

757
38:23.910 --> 38:24.580
Well,

758
38:24.610 --> 38:26.170
what if the other party has no dirt?

759
38:26.170 --> 38:28.380
Wouldn't that be a waste of effort?

760
38:29.380 --> 38:31.710
That's why I said you're silly, Zhengchu.

761
38:31.760 --> 38:33.690
If there isn't any, just make it up.

762
38:36.920 --> 38:37.670
Gefei,

763
38:37.670 --> 38:38.320
you're really amazing.

764
38:38.320 --> 38:39.650
Not only are you pretty,

765
38:39.820 --> 38:42.010
but you're also really good at being a streamer.

766
38:42.010 --> 38:43.010
No, I'm not.

767
38:43.650 --> 38:44.460
Qingsong.

768
38:46.250 --> 38:47.880
Xia asked me to bring this to you.

769
38:47.880 --> 38:48.610
Thanks.

770
38:48.610 --> 38:49.280
Thanks for your trouble.

771
38:49.280 --> 38:50.210
You're welcome.

772
38:53.280 --> 38:53.690
Here.

773
39:03.170 --> 39:03.630
Cheers.

774
39:07.780 --> 39:09.240
Give me a glass of whiskey.

775
39:35.260 --> 39:36.980
Maybe I should just go back.

776
39:38.880 --> 39:40.170
As a girl,

777
39:40.480 --> 39:42.170
you shoot videos and post them online all day.

778
39:42.170 --> 39:42.980
You just let people

779
39:42.980 --> 39:43.780
judge you.

780
39:43.780 --> 39:44.960
Aren't you ashamed?

781
39:46.460 --> 39:48.320
I might as well sit here all night.

782
40:15.420 --> 40:16.680
Did you buy this for me?

783
40:19.570 --> 40:20.130
Yeah.

784
40:22.460 --> 40:23.380
But it's been sitting out for too long.

785
40:23.380 --> 40:24.240
It's gone cold.

786
40:24.670 --> 40:26.130
You can't have it anymore.

787
40:35.380 --> 40:36.650
Five cans of beer?

788
40:38.610 --> 40:40.410
You don't have to eat the congee.

789
40:47.380 --> 40:48.840
I'm in a bad mood right now.

790
40:49.090 --> 40:49.830
I don't want to chase you anymore.

791
40:49.830 --> 40:50.580
Just leave.

792
41:29.650 --> 41:30.360
I...

793
41:31.590 --> 41:33.120
I didn't mean to yell at you.

794
41:38.730 --> 41:39.260
Mm.

795
41:44.260 --> 41:46.320
You threw the alcohol away

796
41:47.650 --> 41:49.980
because I was angry?

797
41:52.670 --> 41:54.610
Maybe I was a little startled.

798
41:55.820 --> 41:57.050
I don't want to interfere too much

799
41:57.050 --> 41:58.310
in your personal life.

800
41:58.980 --> 42:00.360
But you have a bad stomach,

801
42:00.360 --> 42:02.160
and drinking will make it worse.

802
42:02.940 --> 42:03.650
If there's something

803
42:03.650 --> 42:04.380
that makes you unhappy,

804
42:04.380 --> 42:05.980
you can talk to your friends.

805
42:06.380 --> 42:08.040
If you don't have any friends,

806
42:08.150 --> 42:09.070
I can reluctantly

807
42:09.070 --> 42:10.010
be that friend.

808
42:19.760 --> 42:20.960
It doesn't sound like

809
42:23.050 --> 42:24.450
you're reluctant at all.

810
42:26.110 --> 42:28.140
♪ The dusk settles slow ♪

811
42:26.210 --> 42:27.010
Well, what I want to be

812
42:27.010 --> 42:28.170
isn't just your friend.

813
42:28.170 --> 42:31.180
♪ Too faint of heart to follow through ♪

814
42:33.180 --> 42:35.180
♪ It's grown like a habit ♪

815
42:35.200 --> 42:38.200
♪ Awaiting dark clouds to spread ♪

816
42:40.630 --> 42:42.790
♪ Fear promises are shallow ♪

817
42:44.290 --> 42:46.290
♪ No match for the tides of change ♪

818
42:47.870 --> 42:52.280
♪ Let rain soak all that once was ours ♪

819
42:55.190 --> 42:57.550
♪ Lingering right here ♪

820
42:55.650 --> 42:56.300
Stop eating it.

821
42:56.300 --> 42:57.190
It's gone cold.

822
42:57.810 --> 42:59.320
♪ Who tries to talk me down? ♪

823
42:59.360 --> 43:01.180
♪ Who makes excuses now? ♪

824
43:01.210 --> 43:04.160
♪ Let memories trail in threads ♪

825
43:04.810 --> 43:07.860
♪ Too shattered to pick up ♪

826
43:11.010 --> 43:12.740
Why are you still sitting here?

827
43:15.680 --> 43:17.210
Let's talk about tomorrow.

828
43:18.780 --> 43:19.570
Go ahead.

829
43:20.000 --> 43:20.790
Tomorrow,

830
43:21.510 --> 43:22.210
you need to print the brochures

831
43:22.210 --> 43:23.380
in advance.

832
43:24.960 --> 43:25.670
We'll meet at the cafe

833
43:25.670 --> 43:27.130
on the first floor of XUST.

834
43:27.300 --> 43:27.820
Okay.

835
43:31.150 --> 43:32.010
Anything else?

836
43:36.780 --> 43:37.320
No.

837
43:49.790 --> 43:51.610
♪ A thin short line ♪

838
43:49.880 --> 43:51.460
I'll sit for a while longer.

839
43:51.630 --> 43:55.250
♪ Two hearts intertwined ♪

840
43:56.980 --> 43:58.980
♪ Which way to go ♪

841
43:59.270 --> 44:02.250
♪ Might be simpler so ♪

842
44:00.380 --> 44:01.010
I can't quit this game

843
44:01.010 --> 44:02.340
in the middle of a match.

844
44:03.010 --> 44:03.960
Take your time.

845
44:04.290 --> 44:06.040
♪ Some wait for an umbrella ♪

846
44:04.360 --> 44:06.060
I have nothing else to do anyway.

847
44:06.060 --> 44:10.060
♪ Some wait for the sun to show ♪

848
44:11.130 --> 44:16.430
♪ Hesitant feet—which side should I stand on ♪

849
44:18.930 --> 44:21.610
♪ The cold pale moon ♪

850
44:21.630 --> 44:23.220
♪ Never touching the ground ♪

851
44:23.240 --> 44:24.960
♪ Far too out of reach ♪

852
44:24.980 --> 44:27.950
♪ This damp murmur ♪

853
44:28.330 --> 44:32.800
♪ Loud as it is, unheard ♪

854
44:33.460 --> 44:36.810
♪ Afraid it's too late ♪

855
44:36.840 --> 44:39.830
♪ Resentment takes root inside ♪

856
44:40.350 --> 44:45.690
♪ Let debts bid farewell to unease ♪

857
44:45.880 --> 44:47.570
♪ We drift apart, each on our way ♪

858
44:47.590 --> 44:51.110
♪ Maybe someday ♪

859
44:49.510 --> 44:50.230
I'm done.

860
44:51.140 --> 44:53.740
♪ Longing finds its way ♪

861
44:54.070 --> 45:00.780
♪ I hope you write the ending of our tale ♪

862
44:56.530 --> 44:57.530
See you tomorrow.

863
44:58.530 --> 44:59.530
See you tomorrow.

864
45:00.810 --> 45:11.800
♪ I hope you write the ending of our tale ♪

865
45:06.780 --> 45:07.840
I-It's gone cold.

866
45:09.400 --> 45:10.940
Have the hotel heat it up when you get back!
